{"path":"io/basic_ospanstream/swap","title":"std::basic_ospanstream<CharT,Traits>::swap","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::basic_ospanstream&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;::</span>swap","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/io/basic_ospanstream/swap","section":"io","kind":"page","summary":"Exchanges the state of the stream with those of other.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> swap<span class=\"br0\">(</span> basic_ospanstream<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> other <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Exchanges the state of the stream with those of <code>other</code>.\n</p><p>This is done by calling <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostream\"><span class=\"kw1732\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_ostream</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT, Traits<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">swap</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>other<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> and swapping the wrapped <span class=\"t-lc\">std::basic_spanbuf</span> objects (accessible through <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>rdbuf<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>).\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td>  other\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td>  stream to exchange the state with\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<p>May throw implementation-defined exceptions. \n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-notice\">This section is incomplete<br>Reason: no example </div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_spanbuf/swap\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>swap</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  swaps two <code>basic_spanbuf</code> objects <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::basic_spanbuf&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"io","title":"Input/output library"},{"path":"io/basic_ospanstream","title":"std::basic_ospanstream"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::basic_ospanstream<CharT,Traits>::swap","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++23. Exchanges the state of the stream with those of other."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"other"},{"label":"Return value","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"May throw implementation-defined exceptions."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"swap","note":"swaps two basic_spanbuf objects"}]}]},"standards":["C++23"],"wordCount":69,"codeBlockCount":0}
